6=Comp tests were hard and failed in facets/depth hoar above upper crust and then above the lower crust in the second
7=trial. Shovel test produced a hard failure ontop of the upper crust where the knife had cut to.
8=Burp test produced no failure in the upper 40 cm of the  profile.
